  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "title": "Domino V2 deployment manifest",
  "description": "Structural schema. deploy-schema.mjs validates every manifest against this file, then the semantic rules: guarded CREATE3 predictions, policy, role separation, complete canonical receipt coverage, receipts after genesis with one hash per block, and a verification at or after every receipt. backend/v2_manifest.py applies the same rules, one for one."
}
